# Production build config, loaded by Vite during `vite build` on Cloudflare.
# PUBLIC values by design: the anon (publishable) key ships in the client
# bundle and row-level security is the real boundary. The service-role key
# never goes here. Fill these in from Supabase > Project Settings > API and
# commit, so the Cloudflare build always has config.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_KlrK-mwLIcqdg2OjMBgWEA_1g1bK7YV
